  "excerpt": "圓融至德嘉號\n 淨土宗編輯部\n\n        「南無阿彌陀佛」六字名號，被尊為「萬德洪名」，亦被讚歎為「圓滿德號」、「圓融至德嘉號」。\n        「圓」者，是對隔歷之言。相互隔離，各自成一單元者稱「隔歷」；而「圓",
  "bodyHtml": "<div><!--HTML編輯器或是圖文區塊套用此ID--> <h2>圓融至德嘉號</h2> <div>淨土宗編輯部<br /><br /> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;「南無阿彌陀佛」六字名號，被尊為「萬德洪名」，亦被讚歎為「圓滿德號」、「圓融至德嘉號」。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;「圓」者，是對隔歷之言。相互隔離，各自成一單元者稱「隔歷」；而「圓」乃是圓滿周遍，融通無所障礙。圓滿即滿而無缺，如十五夜之月亮，稱為圓月或滿月，光明絲毫無缺。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;阿彌陀佛之名號，是法藏菩薩因位之萬行、果位之萬德，所有六度萬行無量無邊之善根功德，此之萬善萬德圓滿無缺之名號，此謂之圓。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;「融」者，鎔融互通，自在無礙之意。舉凡佛法中所有一切功德，此之萬善萬德，如袋中所納之小石，並非個個各別，而是一即一切，一切即一，無礙融通為一名號。故萬德的當下即是一名號，一名號的當下即是萬德，一多無礙自在，此謂之融。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;「至德」是至極功德之意，功德中的至極，故謂至德，如尊貴中的至極，稱為至尊。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;「嘉號」，「嘉」是善也、美也，盡善盡美之名號，故謂嘉號。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;天臺宗盛談圓融，是立足於「心佛及眾生，是三無差別」之教理，亦即吾人之心具足佛、眾生及十法界之故，心迷即是凡夫，悟即是佛。以心為主而談圓融。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;然而淨土宗是在阿彌陀佛之上談圓融，故謂彌陀名號是圓融至德嘉號，凡夫信之念之，能夠自在無礙地被救。</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;引證佛言祖語如下：</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\">&bull;至心信樂，欲生我國，乃至十念，若不生者，不取正覺。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\">&bull;信心歡喜，乃至一念，至心迴向，願生彼國，即得往生，住不退轉。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\">&bull;其有得聞彼佛名號，歡喜踴躍乃至一念，<br /> &nbsp; 當知此人為得大利，則是具足無上功德。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\">&bull;我至成佛道，名聲超十方，究竟有不聞，誓不成等覺。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\">&bull;其佛本願力，聞名欲往生，皆悉到彼國，自致不退轉。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\">&bull;我若成正覺，立名無量壽，眾生聞此號，俱來我剎中；<br /> &nbsp; 如佛金色身，妙相悉圓滿，亦以大悲心，利益諸群品。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──《大經》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;光明遍照十方世界，念佛眾生攝取不捨。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;若念佛者，當知此人，則是人中芬陀利華。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;佛告阿難：「汝好持是語，持是語者，即是持無量壽佛名。</span></strong></span>」</p> <p>──《觀經》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;上來雖說定散兩門之益，望佛本願，意在眾生一向專稱彌陀佛名</span></span></strong>。</p> <p>──《觀經疏》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;無量壽佛，無量無邊不可思議功德名號。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──《小經》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;若人欲疾至，不退轉地者，應以恭敬心，執持稱名號。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──《易行品》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong>&bull;稱彼如來名，如彼如來光明智相，如彼名義，欲如實修行相應故。</strong></span></span></p> <p>──《往生論》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;無礙光如來名號，能破眾生一切無明，能滿眾生一切志願。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;阿彌陀如來真實清淨無量功德名號。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;阿彌陀如來至極無生清淨寶珠名號。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;緣佛願力故，十念念佛，便得往生。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──《往生論註》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;自餘眾行，雖名是善，若比念佛者，全非比較也。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;念佛三昧，功能超絕；實非雜善，得為比類。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;極樂無為涅槃界，隨緣雜善恐難生；<br /> &nbsp; 故使如來選要法，教念彌陀專復專。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;彌陀身色如金山，相好光明照十方；<br /> &nbsp; 唯有念佛蒙光攝，當知本願最為強。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;種種法門皆解脫，無過念佛往西方。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;一切善業迴生利，不如專念彌陀號。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;萬行俱迴皆得往，念佛一行最為尊。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;利劍即是彌陀號，一聲稱念罪皆除。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;謗法闡提行十惡，迴心念佛罪皆除。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──善導大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;諸佛願行，成此果名；但能念號，<br /> &nbsp; 具包眾德，故成大善，不廢往生。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──窺基大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;名號者是萬德之所歸也。<br /> &nbsp;&nbsp;然則彌陀一佛所有四智、三身、十力、四無畏等一切內證功德，<br /> &nbsp;&nbsp;相好、光明、說法、利生等一切外用功德，皆悉攝在阿彌陀佛名號之中。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;弘願一稱者，萬行之宗致；果號三字者，眾德之根源。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──法然上人</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;彌陀名號之中，即彼如來從初發心乃至佛果，所有一切萬行萬德，皆悉具足，無有缺減。<br /> &nbsp; 非唯彌陀一佛功德，亦攝十方諸佛功德。<br /> &nbsp;&nbsp;今此佛號文字雖少，具足眾德。如如意珠形體雖少，雨無量財。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──永觀上人《往生十因》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;應念阿彌陀佛名，此名攝無量無邊功德。<br /> &nbsp; 稱念此名，無量功德來集我身，無始至今，煩惱惡業，皆悉消除。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──珍海上人《菩提心集》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;此行即是攝諸善法，具諸德本，極速圓滿，真如一實，功德寶海，故名大行。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──親鸞上人《教行信證》</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;一乘極唱，終歸咸指於樂邦；萬行圓修，最勝獨推於果號。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;念佛三昧者，具縛凡愚，屠沽下類，剎那超越成佛之法也。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──元照大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;佛名乃是積劫薰修，攬其萬德，總彰四字，是故稱之，獲益非淺。</span></strong></span></p> <p>──戒度大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;今若以我心口，稱念一佛嘉號，則從因至果，無量功德，無不具足。</span></strong></span></p> <p>──用欽大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;諸佛皆德施名，稱名即稱德，德能滅罪生福，名亦如是。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──法位大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;一稱嘉號，萬德齊彰；罪銷塵劫，福等虛空。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──大佑大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;越三祇於一念，齊諸聖於片言。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;舉其名兮，兼眾德而具備；專乎持也，統百行以無遺。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;持名乃善中之善，福中之福。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;執持名號，願見彌陀，誠多善根、大善根、最勝善根、不可思議善根。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;彌陀乃萬德名號，一名才舉，萬德齊圓。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;專持名號，猶勝持咒，亦勝餘咒，亦勝一切諸餘功德。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;六度萬行，法門無量，而專持名號，則種種功德，攝無不盡。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──蓮池大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;光壽二義，收盡一切無量。<br /> &nbsp; 光則橫遍十方，壽則豎窮三際；橫豎交徹，即法界體。<br /> &nbsp; 舉此體作彌陀身土，亦即舉此體作彌陀名號。<br /> &nbsp; 故一念相應一念佛，念念相應念念佛也。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;持名，善根福德同佛。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;持名者，光明壽命，同佛無異。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;阿彌陀佛是萬德洪名，以名召德，罄無不盡。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;信願持名，全攝佛功德成自功德。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;一聲阿彌陀佛，即釋迦本師於五濁惡世所得之阿耨多羅三藐三菩提法。<br /> &nbsp; 今以此果覺，全體授與濁惡眾生。</span></strong></span></p> <p><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;六字洪名真法界，不須方便自橫超。</span></strong></span></p> <p>──蕅益大師</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;阿彌陀佛所證之菩提覺道，即阿彌陀佛一句萬德洪名，包攝淨盡。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;阿彌陀佛是法界藏身，所有十方法界諸佛功德，阿彌陀佛一佛全體具足。<br /> &nbsp; 如帝網珠，千珠攝於一珠，一珠遍於千珠。舉一全收，無欠無餘。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;阿彌陀佛萬德洪名，如大冶洪爐。<br /> &nbsp; 吾人多生罪業，如空中片雪。<br /> &nbsp; 業力凡夫，由念佛故，業便消滅。<br /> &nbsp; 如片雪近於洪爐，即便了不可得。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;一句佛號，包括一大藏教，罄無不盡。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;一代時教，皆念佛法門之註腳。</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span style=\"font-family:標楷體\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&bull;莫訝一稱超十地，須知六字括三乘。</span></span></strong></p> <p>──印光大師</p> </div> </div>",
